  - Row-level security (003_enable_rls.sql
    (backend/migrations/003_enable_rls.sql)): turned on for every table with no
    access rules. Without it, anyone with the publishable key, which ships to
    every browser, could read or rewrite games through Supabase's Data API. Our
    backend owns the tables, so RLS doesn't restrict it.
