  4. End-to-end test

  1. Open https://<your-service>.onrender.com/api/health first to wake the free
     instance. Wait for {"ok":true,"db":true}.
  2. Open the Vercel URL, sign up or sign in, and pick a username. This is the
     first account in the Supabase database.
  3. Create a game and open the invite link in a private window as a guest. Play
     some moves, or resign to finish quickly.
  4. Check that the analysis appears and the game shows under "Your recent
     games."

